      "content": "X = 1_B \\Rightarrow G^*(Y) = \\frac{\\mathbb{E} 1_B 1_A}{\\mathbb{P}(A)} 1_A + \\frac{\\mathbb{E} 1_B 1_{A^c}}{\\mathbb{P}(A^c)} 1_{A^c}"
    },
